This product includes data derived from the GS1 Barcode Syntax Dictionary
(https://github.com/gs1/gs1-syntax-dictionary), vendored at
data/gs1-syntax-dictionary.txt and compiled into src/ai.rs. The vendored copy
is upstream commit bc3bff068557702f236f81d9481772ace750db31 (2026-07-27), which
is five association-rule fixes past the 2026-01-27 release, and is kept
unmodified: it is byte-identical to upstream's file at that commit, whose
`# Release:` line reads `UNSET` as it does between releases. The release
identification lives in data/UPSTREAM instead, which also records the file's
SHA-256.

